===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Euclidean]] [[geometry]]|-}}

# {{context|geometry|lang=en}} The [[familiar]] geometry of the [[real world]], based on the [[postulate]] that through any two [[point]]s there is exactly one [[straight line]].

